    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "AA1748EB935D2D01",
      "text": "Pourquoi ces pauvres statuettes devraient-elles\\npayer pour les crimes commis par les Adoramis ?![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_12",
      "hash64": "AA1745EB935D27E8",
      "text": "Bref, pour les restaurer et ainsi remédier\\nà ce désastre, j’ai décidé de lancer\\r\\nune [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]collecte de fonds pour les statuettes[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_13",
      "hash64": "AA1746EB935D299B",
      "text": "Le montant minimum de chaque don est de\\n10 000 . J’espère rassembler 1 000 000  ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_14",
      "hash64": "AA174BEB935D321A",
      "text": "Loin de moi l’idée de réclamer une telle somme\\nà toi et à tes camarades.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_15",
      "hash64": "AA174CEB935D33CD",
      "text": "Mais si vous pouviez en glisser un mot\\nà vos parents et à vos professeurs,\\r\\nje vous en serais reconnaissant ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
