      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_38",
      "hash64": "AA1043EB935705D4",
      "text": "Nous avons réussi à rassembler 1 000 000  ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_24",
      "hash64": "AA13BDEB935A0AF9",
      "text": "Nous allons enfin pouvoir réparer les statuettes\\ndes Adoramis ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_25",
      "hash64": "AA13BCEB935A0946",
      "text": "Je vais tout de suite passer un coup de fil\\npour lancer les réparations !\\c\\nEnfin, il faudrait que je me souvienne\\ndu numéro... Ah, ça y est ! *tut* *tut* *tut*[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
